  "hooks": [
    {
      "text": "夜晚黑暗会持续吞噬理智并显露潜伏怪物，点燃火把是失去理智前唯一的生存手段",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "The darkness will gradually consume your sanity, and the distorted monsters lurking in the dark will gradually reveal themselves and show their fangs. No matter how brave the survivors are, they can't survive in the darkness after losing their sanity. Lighting a torch will be the only way for you to survive!",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3419290/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "职业天赋之外可任意使用武器和起始技能，并把扩展效果像技能符文一样自由镶嵌改写招式",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "In addition to the exclusive talent tree for each class, you can use any weapon and starting skills. A large number of unique skills and skill expansion effects allow you to have a different combat experience in each game. Similar to the skill runes in \"Path of Exile\", they can be freely inlaid on skills to change their effects, making the richness and combination of builds an endless possibility.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3419290/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "随机属性装备可从怪物、Boss、商人或赌博获得，另有数百件传奇物品等待发现",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Loot is randomly generated, with ever - changing attributes. You can obtain it from monsters, bosses, or merchants, and you can even use the gambling function to get some powerful equipment. There are also hundreds of powerful legendary items waiting for you to discover in the game.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3419290/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    }
  ],
